{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301320","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301320","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1830132001:1":{"text":"맛있는 걸 찾고 있어... 한참을 돌아다녔는데, 이 망할 동네엔 왜 맛집이 하나도 없는 거야?","source_cn":"我们在寻找美食……走了半天，这鬼地方怎么连个美食店都没有？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x436524A1177686E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830132002:1":{"text":"그레이브본은 음식을 먹을 필요가 없다니, 누가 알았겠어...","source_cn":"谁能想到亡灵居然不用吃东西……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ADFFE45F039CE68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830132003:1":{"text":"어쩌면 몰래 들어온 사람 상대로 장사하는 그레이브본이 있을지도 몰라. “반티스풍 간식” 같은 걸 파는 거지.","source_cn":"说不定会有亡灵做偷渡者的生意，卖一些“班题斯特色小吃”...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D658E489E367503","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830132004:1":{"text":"반티스풍 간식? 그거 먹을 수 있겠어?","source_cn":"班题斯特色小吃？你敢吃吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEDDFE7A153ED814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830132005:1":{"text":"먹고 나면 그대로 기절해서, 다시 눈을 떴을 땐 반티스한테 붙잡혀 마차에 실려 있을지도 몰라!","source_cn":"没准吃完咱们就昏过去了，再睁眼的时候就被班题斯绑到了马车上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A5AB72919A71F33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1830132006:1":{"text":"그럼 우린 어떡해? 그렇다고 아무것도 안 먹고 버틸 순 없잖아!","source_cn":"那我们怎么办？总不能喝西北风填肚子吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2165C93BAF3DFB50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1830132007:1":{"text":"조금만 더 찾아보자... 주점 하나는 있겠지!","source_cn":"再找找吧……我就不信这里一家酒馆都没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B7E9446EC886FE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:斯丹利":{"text":"스탄리","source":"斯丹利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:弗农":{"text":"버논","source":"弗农","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}